   "x1": 539.57632,
   "top": 115.44463999999994,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "An Act to amend the law relating to the Transfer of Property by act of Parties.",
   "page": 7,
   "x0": 102.86,
   "x1": 507.9620000000001,
   "top": 133.41199999999992,
   "size": 12.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "Preamble.—WHEREAS it is expedient to define and amend certain parts of the law",
   "page": 7,
   "x0": 90.024,
   "x1": 535.1458399999999,
   "top": 151.68463999999994,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "Preamble",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "relating to the transfer of property by act of parties; It is hereby enacted as follows:—",
   "page": 7,
   "x0": 72.024,
   "x1": 500.98,
   "top": 163.80463999999995,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "CHAPTER I",
