   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "PRELIMINARY",
   "page": 7,
   "x0": 274.61,
   "x1": 337.142,
   "top": 199.68463999999994,
   "size": 9.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "1. Short title.—This Act may be called the Transfer of Property Act, 1882.",
   "page": 7,
   "x0": 90.024,
   "x1": 482.5,
   "top": 216.48464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "1. Short title.—",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "Commencement.—It shall come into force on the first day of July, 1882.",
   "page": 7,
   "x0": 90.024,
   "x1": 414.4292,
   "top": 232.35464000000002,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "Commencement.—",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "Extent.— [It extends in the first instance to the whole of India. except [the",
   "page": 7,
   "x0": 90.024,
   "x1": 535.48624,
   "top": 245.79463999999996,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "Extent",
   "markers": [
    "1",
    "2",
    "3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "territories which, immediately before the 1st November, 1956, were comprised in Part B",
   "page": 7,
   "x0": 72.024,
   "x1": 534.6662399999999,
   "top": 257.55463999999995,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "States or in the States of], Bombay, Punjab and Delhi.]",
   "page": 7,
   "x0": 72.024,
   "x1": 353.2569599999999,
   "top": 269.31463999999994,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "[But this Act or any part thereof may by notification in the Official Gazette be",
   "page": 7,
   "x0": 95.064,
   "x1": 535.0434399999999,
   "top": 282.51464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": [
    "4",
    "5"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "extended to the whole or any part of [the said territories] by the State Government",
   "page": 7,
   "x0": 72.024,
   "x1": 535.15976,
   "top": 294.63464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": [
    "6"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "concerned.]",
   "page": 7,
   "x0": 72.024,
   "x1": 129.9288,
   "top": 306.87464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "[And any State Government may *** from time to time, by notification in the Official",
   "page": 7,
   "x0": 93.504,
   "x1": 534.96296,
   "top": 319.71464000000003,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": [
    "7",
    "8"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Gazette, exempt, either retrospectively or prospectively, any part of the territories",
   "page": 7,
   "x0": 72.024,
   "x1": 535.28776,
   "top": 331.71464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
