   "x0": 81.024,
   "x1": 535.0920000000001,
   "top": 448.054,
   "size": 9.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "Reg. 8 of 1965, s. 3 and Sch., to Pondicherry by Act 26 of 1968, s. 3 and Sch.",
   "page": 7,
   "x0": 81.024,
   "x1": 390.99100000000004,
   "top": 457.774,
   "size": 9.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "It has been amended to Bombay by Bombay Act 14 of 1939, 57 of 1959, in U.P. by U.P. Act 24 of 1954, 14 of 1970 and 57",
   "page": 7,
   "x0": 90.024,
   "x1": 535.3720000000001,
   "top": 467.854,
   "size": 9.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "of 1976.",
